# Colossus of the Strait - the island's own part of its test (the plan test includes this one; colossus_of_the_strait.play
# fetches the three gears from the earlier islands first, then includes it).
# 10-25 deep pass: after Kett's note, Strait Head (50 45, 22 m; trail foot 50 26) and Grey's mast (the sluice key), the
# builders' cistern at -30 72 (-10 m; its chest tried first without the key), Hesk's tablet.
island Colossus of the Strait
offset 0 0
expect title The Giant's Heart
walk -66 0 to -52 0 h=5
zone west_headland
read Syndicate camp orders
zone syndicate_camp
kill Hyena
expect step 3
open Syndicate strongbox
expect story raft-Tangaroa_KeyCard 1
walk -36 -4 to -30 0 to -28 0 h=5
zone heel_door
use heeldoor
expect hidden heeldoor
expect step 6
walk -27 0 to -23 0 h=5
use lift
wait 6
expect story heelride 1
expect height 18.3
zone chest_chamber
read Builders' inscription
kill Mama bear
expect step 10
use gearwheel
expect story gear1 0
expect story gear3 0
expect shown eyes
expect shown headladder
use headladder
expect height 22.4
zone head
open Crown vault
expect story kettshat 1
expect item TitaniumIngot 3
read Kett's note
expect step 14
open Builders' chest
expect message sluice key
zone straitfoot
expect step 15
zone straittop
expect step 16
read Silas Grey's lookout log
expect step 17
open Grey's lookout box
wait 3
expect story sluicekey 1
# (the key-less try already took the player into the zone, so the reach step counts with the key)
zone cistern
expect step 19
open Builders' chest
wait 2
expect step 20
read Master builder Hesk
expect done
